Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.48,0:12:17.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was it sweet?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.56,0:12:20.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't you take a bite\Nand tell me what you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.14,0:12:37.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A meowsing hot dog stays the\Nbestest when you're outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.00,0:12:44.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's mine, you fucking hot dog thief!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.60,0:12:47.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're going down, you flying bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.62,0:13:08.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.66,0:13:10.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where do you think you're going with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.28,0:13:12.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a big ol' hawk, or is it a falcon?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.18,0:13:14.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that your new pet?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.74,0:13:16.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to rotisserie and steal an ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.84,0:13:19.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You do that kind of thing with a chicken.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.16,0:13:21.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't do that with a bird of prey.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.26,0:13:23.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you're telling me\Nthere's some special list
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.42,0:13:25.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of what birds we can eat\Nand what birds we don't?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.58,0:13:26.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it is a law.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.66,0:13:30.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.54,0:13:33.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go grab a bite to eat somewhere. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.06,0:13:34.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.97,0:13:37.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you've got to let that bird go, deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.62,0:13:39.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cigarettes, here I come!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.32,0:13:50.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That bird's eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.86,0:13:54.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I felt something powerful in them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.64,0:13:56.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A fairy tale.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.06,0:14:05.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You... you're...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.04,0:14:08.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hi, handsome.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.42,0:14:09.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You saved my life today.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.08,0:14:13.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've returned here to spread\Nmy wings of gratitude for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.66,0:14:16.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.08,0:14:18.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should have more\Nrespect for your bird flesh.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.00,0:14:25.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the least I can do to repay you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.80,0:14:52.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.20,0:15:00.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The odds of something like that happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.34,0:15:12.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Morning already?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.02,0:15:16.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time to get to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.98,0:15:30.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm all out of ideas.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.78,0:15:32.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm horrible at my job.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.54,0:15:33.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have no talent.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.88,0:15:36.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm in a world where\Ntalent is all that matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.36,0:15:39.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to quit, but I don't want\Nto go back to the countryside.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.40,0:15:40.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't do this anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.90,0:15:42.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to draw, but I don't want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.92,0:15:44.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the deadline is...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.22,0:15:54.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.13,0:15:57.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn, this costume that I\Nbought for reference is insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.20,0:16:00.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who the hell could even\Nfight crime in this thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.26,0:16:04.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My body's flabby, but it's not too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.82,0:16:09.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I can't make a living drawing manga,\Nthen maybe I can make one with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.76,0:16:12.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's that time of the month again
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.08,0:16:14.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.99,0:16:18.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Landlord, this isn't what it looks\Nlike I'm just wearing this for research
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.76,0:16:19.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boner
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.20,0:16:23.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, you're here for the rent, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.12,0:16:26.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry you had to see me\Nin this outfit No, Boner
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.00,0:16:33.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boner? No, Boner.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.64,0:16:36.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boner
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.90,0:16:45.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chainsmoker cat, yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.62,0:17:06.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hope I'm not interrupting.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.82,0:17:09.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, you understand the importance of naps.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.68,0:17:12.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But at the expense of\Nyour schoolwork, it seems.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.64,0:17:17.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know that it's getting warmer outside,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.98,0:17:22.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but those who sleep with their bellies\Nexposed often wake with a cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.52,0:17:30.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.43,0:17:34.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Such a generous heart, willing to share\Nthe comfort of a bath amongst your friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.32,0:17:38.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The simple ease that modern life has\Nerased can be found within this apartment.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.80,0:17:45.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If people stopped keeping everything for\Nthemselves and learned to live together,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.58,0:17:49.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then perhaps this uncertain\Nworld might finally know peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.30,0:17:54.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, my, my.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.14,0:17:57.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing but a stockpile\Nof alcohol and snacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.10,0:18:01.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Such little nutrition, you'll\Ncertainly ruin your health.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.46,0:18:03.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll ease your burden of alcohol.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.78,0:18:07.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, your health is at the\Nforefront of my mind, young one.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.94,0:18:10.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, I'll take these snacks, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.54,0:18:14.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nyagamihara City was the location of a
Dialogue: 1,0:18:13.67,0:18:20.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}THIEF ARRESTED AFTER BARRICADING HIMSELF
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.32,0:18:16.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,trespassing and theft\Ncrime earlier this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.76,0:18:20.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A 31-year-old man was arrested\Nat the scene of these crimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.44,0:18:22.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The suspect has denied charges against him
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.92,0:18:24.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and claims he was\Nborrowing and not stealing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.00,0:18:28.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we believe he could be\Nconnected to other robberies.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.12,0:18:32.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To go and steal from another simply because\Nyou yourself are experiencing hunger?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.54,0:18:34.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll never be able to\Nunderstand people like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.84,0:18:37.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're hungry, you\Nshould ask someone for help.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.96,0:18:42.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are plenty of people and places in\Nthe world that help out those in need.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.30,0:18:46.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's a brainwashed victim\Nof a system that teaches
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.42,0:18:49.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,people to value possessions\Nover compassion.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.62,0:18:51.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Aru, coming in. It's rent day.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.38,0:18:54.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh, someone's doing some nap time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.62,0:18:56.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, yoo-hoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.48,0:18:59.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jeez, you must sleep 20 hours a day.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.26,0:19:02.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pervert.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.30,0:19:03.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.40,0:19:06.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should be counting your lucky\Nstars, it was just me coming in!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.88,0:19:08.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're taking a nap\Nwithout locking your door?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.92,0:19:09.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.83,0:19:13.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With all the burglars and creeps\Naround here, you've gotta be careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.42,0:19:17.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you listening? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.36,0:19:20.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you looking at? Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.70,0:19:26.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean those monsters that\Ncome out of the ceiling?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.32,0:19:29.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At your age, you're still\Nbelieving in those silly stories?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.24,0:19:32.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get back to the real\Nworld. Wake up and pay up!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.50,0:19:35.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something wet and slimy just touched me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.78,0:19:36.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.70,0:19:38.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's one of those ceiling lickers!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.36,0:19:39.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A ten-john-a-me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.98,0:19:42.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I sense it's evil!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.18,0:19:44.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No napping!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.04,0:19:47.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chainsmoker Cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.96,0:20:12.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, Kansai, huh? Let's\Nhave a little chat, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.46,0:20:13.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.10,0:20:18.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have cancer and less than a year left
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.40,0:20:36.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What if I had laughed just now, but it\Nturned out you were telling the truth?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.76,0:20:38.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you want to be funny, try again!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.88,0:20:43.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay then, I'll quit smoking.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.84,0:20:46.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not joking, now you're just lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.54,0:20:48.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then show me how it's done, Ms.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.32,0:20:49.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Know-It-All.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.23,0:20:50.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How to be funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.44,0:20:52.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And reveal all my magic?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.18,0:20:56.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess it wouldn't be the end of\Nthe world if I showed you one or two.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.56,0:20:58.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ain't like all of a\Nsudden you're a comedian.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.52,0:21:00.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this gonna take a long time?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.66,0:21:01.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.66,0:21:02.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.94,0:21:04.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this you as a little Kansai?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.26,0:21:06.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those are my two children.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.92,0:21:09.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perfect reaction, Yani.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.60,0:21:10.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aren't they cute?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.68,0:21:12.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone's gonna flip their shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.16,0:21:12.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.07,0:21:13.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, you moron!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.76,0:21:17.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You asked me to teach you,\Nso that's what I was doing!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.74,0:21:18.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was a joke!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.00,0:21:20.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, just so you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.60,0:21:24.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think it's weird that you carry around\Na picture of you and your little brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.30,0:21:25.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, yeah, so what if I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.88,0:21:26.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There a problem with it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.06,0:21:30.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I knew this already,\Nbut you're funny, Kansai.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.52,0:21:31.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.78,0:21:33.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got me blushing now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.76,0:21:35.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What on earth's gotten into you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.54,0:21:36.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I lied.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.45,0:21:40.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I just thought of something\Nfunny, so I'm gonna go borrow Shunran.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.08,0:21:41.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't think I'm funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.18,0:21:43.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,School trip next month!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.14,0:21:45.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's excited?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.62,0:21:48.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder what I'll get Big Sis as a gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.32,0:21:50.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, she'll love some snacks for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.26,0:21:54.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Speaking of…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.22,0:21:55.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, guess who texted?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:58.02,0:21:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}TODAY\NI'M PREGNANT
Dialogue: 1,0:22:00.06,0:22:02.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}THIS IS THE FATHER
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.98,0:22:04.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,BUN IN THE OVEN!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.28,0:22:08.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,WHAT IN THE ACTUAL BUN?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.08,0:23:30.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.84,0:24:01.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.68,0:24:34.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.

